s played out."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the Airbnb RevPAR in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Each night a Myrtle Beach listing was open to book earned $106 on average over the past year, booked or not. That figure, revenue per available night (RevPAR), folds price and occupancy into one number; the top 10% of listings made $204 or more."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far in advance do guests book Airbnbs in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Myrtle Beach stays were booked 52 days (about seven weeks) before arrival on average over the past year, so most of a month is booked well before it starts."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long do guests stay at Airbnbs in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The average Myrtle Beach Airbnb stay lasted 4.7 nights over the past year. A listing took 19 reservations over the year on average."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are Airbnbs in Myrtle Beach rated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Guests rate Myrtle Beach Airbnbs 4.66 out of 5 on average. Guests score location highest and cleanliness lowest."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the best neighborhoods for Airbnb in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Broadway at the Beach, Myrtle Beach Boardwalk and Promenade and West Myrtle Beach draw the most short-term rental interest in Myrtle Beach. The neighborhood guide explains what brings guests to each."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many Airbnbs are there in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AirROI counted 8,698 active Airbnb listings in Myrtle Beach as of September 2026. The closest tracked market is Fantasy Harbour, 5 km away."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much are Airbnb cleaning fees in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In Myrtle Beach, about nine in ten listings add a cleaning fee, and the typical fee is about $151."}}]},{"@type":"Place","@id