+</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="not-prose my-6"><aside class="pseo-callout flex gap-3 p-4 font-lato text-[#1e293b] sm:p-5 [&#38;_a]:text-[#1565c0] rounded-[4px] bg-[#eef2f6]">  <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed">  Bookings are AirROI&#39;s figures for the 551 active Surfside Beach listings in the 12 months to September 2026. The average listing is the mean of all of them, including those open only part of the year; the top-quarter listing earns at the 75th percentile of monthly revenue, over a full year. Running costs are the low end of typical shares for a host who runs the listing themselves, with Surfside Beach&#39;s own figures setting the Airbnb fee and the cleaning fee. Not included: one-time setup such as furniture and photos, and income tax, which running costs and mortgage interest often reduce. Lines are rounded, and each total adds up the lines shown. </div> </aside></div><h3>Estimate Your Own Surfside Beach Airbnb Profit</h3><p>
